"body": {"content": [{"endIndex": 1, "sectionBreak": {"sectionStyle": {"columnSeparatorStyle": "NONE", "contentDirection": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "sectionType": "CONTINUOUS"}}}, {"endIndex": 14, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 14, "startIndex": 1, "textRun": {"content": "Boxe adaptée\n", "textStyle": {"backgroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.92941177, "green": 0.65882355, "red": 0.8509804}}}, "bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 1}, {"endIndex": 46, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 46, "startIndex": 14, "textRun": {"content": "Qu’est ce que la boxe adaptée ?\n", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 14}, {"endIndex": 47, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 47, "startIndex": 46, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 46}, {"endIndex": 644, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 644, "startIndex": 47, "textRun": {"content": "C’est une séance de Boxe encadrée par des coachs professionnels  qui se déroule en salle pendant 90 minutes. Contrairement au cours de boxe traditionnelle, celle-ci reprend les techniques de la  boxe afin de s'adapter aux personnes atteintes et/ou ayant été atteintes d'un cancer ou d'autres maladies. Nos coachs vous font évoluer selon votre rythme, votre capacité et votre condition physique.  Aucun coup n’est porté aux corps, ce qui veut dire qu’aucun combat n’est effectué.  L’activité physique est essentiel et la boxe reste un atout majeur face à la dépression, la peur, les angoisses etc \n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 47}, {"endIndex": 645, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 645, "startIndex": 644, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 644}, {"endIndex": 674, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 674, "startIndex": 645, "textRun": {"content": "Bienfaits de la boxe adaptée\n", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "headingId": "h.4b9ariw64ok7", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2", "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 4, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 645}, {"endIndex": 699, "paragraph": {"bullet":